Emily,

The receipt export has the right seal serials. A stores picking ticket is
not the as-left record: use the signed closed fitment, and keep REMOVED
entries separate. I reopened the paperwork for a photograph, so there is
a later OPEN revision with an old serial still on it.

The sketch was made looking back from the access hatch. The witness walk
was B, D, A, C. That is the order on the signed closeout, even though the
cabinet doors read A through D when you stand in the corridor.

Nothing further needed from stores today. The replacement door gasket can
come on the next ordinary boat; this closeout is for the seal rack itself.

Simon
